**$ENCRYPTED_LIB
**$INTERFACE
*$
* Model Usage Notes:
* Model requirement 
* - Maximum step size 10ns
* - Analog simulation speed level 3 
* - VIN initial condition = 0V
* - The parameter DUALOUTPUT has been used to configure the model  
* - Keep DUALOUTPUT=1 for dual-output single-phse config
* - Keep DUALOUTPUT=0 for single-output dual-phase config
* The model supports ;
* - Dual-output (DO) Single-phase config (DUALOUTPUT=1 in Parameter)
* - Single-output (SO) Dual-phase config (DUALOUTPUT=0 in Parameter)
* - FPWM mode (FPWM_AUTO = VCC)
* - AUTO mode (FPWM_AUTO = GND) 
* - Internal FB (3.3V, 5.0V) , external FB
* - Internal compensation(DO), external compensation(SO)
* - EN1, EN2, PG1, PG2
* - 2.3ms PGOOD delay
* - 4.5ms internal SS (DO), external SS (SO)
* - Current limit, Hiccup mode protection
* - Enable, UVLO, Internal boot diode.
* - Programmable switching frequency by RT
* The model doesn't support;
* - Power loss, operating quiescent current, shutdiwn IQ
* - low IQ standby mode, parameter variation, temperature dependent characteristics 
* - Spread Spectrum (CFG)
* - External clock synchronization (SYNC)
* - 4-PH, 6-PH configuration (CFG, SYNCOUT, MODE)
* - VCC current limit(VCC)
* - FB config latch
* - PLL circuit is simplified
* - Hiccup counter is simplified.
* - 13ms forced SS_DONE in DO mode
* - 600us enable delay
* - 88ms hiccup mode off-time
* - 13m hiccup counter delay
* - 200us configuration time 
*****************************************************************************
*$

